{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922040627_853a12ef","chunk_index":2,"job_id":"mwjob_cffd00bfa3697e3b95523084","precondition_digest":"f483172f30b055a8b1e1a0031ff9bcf82f903ed2e0e2f5846600e2e4c3920808","project_id":"proj_user_8a5a00cb014a","schema_version":"protocol_full_draft_chunk_v8","section_ids":["mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_2b3b651762037aa3","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_0d1c72ba25343e73","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_cf9127212cfac33d","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_650a3ed48fbc8ff8"],"sections":[{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922040627_853a12ef","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:6e9fbb2a9321a9f5e7abd8fa","quote":"章节编号=2.3\n章节标题=研究药物简介\n章节类型=section\n当前正文=合成试验药A","quote_sha256":"b4bd486112a1a44995254d2e9f782bfadf90ba0f1a8bbab02be567e32862a26c","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:6e9fbb2a9321a9f5e7abd8fa","span_id":"ev_pkt_23"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"试验药物：合成试验药A\n适应症：成人中重度斑块状银屑病\n研究分期：III期\n开发区域：中国\n内在研究目的：确证性研究","quote_sha256":"143053138b63df4dcc738e4d7c2ca91c3f4320c2cc287f3c8021acb5ca9f698a","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"ev_def_drug"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"药物技术类型：small_molecule\n给药途径：口服\n剂型：口服固体制剂\n局部/系统暴露范围：systemic","quote_sha256":"93d70823288385813f38b773b8c6e7bba227a7ed893796844d8834e9f3bae884","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"ev_def_route"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"试验干预：试验组接受合成试验药A 100 mg口服，每日一次，连续16周；对照组接受匹配安慰剂。","quote_sha256":"f3eff5ef57b4691ff025db695140e4ead682562786c0dec621edcd256ef28af3","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"ev_def_interv"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"剂量与给药方案：合成试验药A：100 mg，每日一次（QD）（口服）；第1天至第16周。依从：通过药品计数及受试者日记评价依从性","quote_sha256":"e97da70f0c9a5d6f604a29b6c054d0ed03fc9fd60470293f55ab4afbebddcff0","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"ev_def_dose"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"匹配安慰剂：每日一次（QD）（口服）；第1天至第16周双盲治疗期。依从：通过药品计数及受试者日记评价依从性","quote_sha256":"6e161fdc710a0a80dfd37e8087ba89849d7bfdb2aa6b1f8d9a2466c304e8fae9","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"ev_def_placebo"}],"evidence_span_ids":["ev_pkt_23","ev_def_drug","ev_def_route","ev_def_interv","ev_def_dose","ev_def_placebo"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":5},"heading":"研究药物简介","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究试验药物为合成试验药A，适应症为成人中重度斑块状银屑病。合成试验药A属于小分子药物，给药途径为口服，剂型为口服固体制剂，药物暴露范围为全身性。在本研究中，合成试验药A的给药方案为100 mg、每日一次（QD）口服，自第1天至第16周；对照组受试者接受与合成试验药A匹配的安慰剂，每日一次（QD）口服，给药时期为第1天至第16周双盲治疗期。试验组与对照组受试者的用药依从性均通过药品计数及受试者日记进行评价。本研究为III期临床研究，开发区域为中国。","rationale":"正文依据已确认研究事实撰写：试验药物为合成试验药A，适应症为成人中重度斑块状银屑病，属小分子药物，口服给药，剂型为口服固体制剂，暴露范围为全身性；给药方案为100 mg、每日一次，第1天至第16周，对照组使用匹配安慰剂，依从性通过药品计数及受试者日记评价；研究分期为III期，开发区域为中国。医学作者需核对并补充作用机制、药理学分类、规格、贮存条件及生产与包装信息，并依据研究者手册或药学资料确认。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_2b3b651762037aa3","section_number":"2.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:6e9fbb2a9321a9f5e7abd8fa","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:b5cb8043e0359e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:367cbc36976ba5","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:d84680fc442c0c"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922040627_853a12ef","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"heading":"非临床研究结果","missing_source_classes":["研究者手册（IB）","研究药物非临床研究资料（药理学、药代动力学、毒理学）"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"该章节当前正文为空。当前已提供来源不包含研究药物的非临床研究资料（药理学、药代动力学、毒理学）或研究者手册，无法在不臆造数据的前提下形成实质正文。医学作者需在取得相应资料后补充非临床研究的试验设计、主要结果及其对临床研究设计的支持性信息。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_0d1c72ba25343e73","section_number":"2.3.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:6e9fbb2a9321a9f5e7abd8fa","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:b5cb8043e0359e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:367cbc36976ba5","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:d84680fc442c0c"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922040627_853a12ef","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"heading":"既往临床研究结果","missing_source_classes":["研究者手册（IB）","研究药物既往临床研究结果资料（已完成临床试验报告或数据）","合成试验药A已发表或未发表的临床研究文献"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"该章节当前正文为空。当前已提供来源不包含研究药物的既往临床研究结果、研究者手册或相关临床文献，无法在不臆造数据的前提下形成实质正文。医学作者需在取得既往临床研究资料后补充已完成研究的受试者人群、给药方案、疗效与安全性结果及其对本研究设计的支持性信息。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_cf9127212cfac33d","section_number":"2.3.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:6e9fbb2a9321a9f5e7abd8fa","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:b5cb8043e0359e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:367cbc36976ba5","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:d84680fc442c0c"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922040627_853a12ef","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:6e9fbb2a9321a9f5e7abd8fa","quote":"章节编号=2.4\n章节标题=本研究的理论基础\n章节类型=section\n当前正文=确证性研究","quote_sha256":"254b989573481ef69049cb53a90ea720889b9c2394652c9fa93aa918d68f42ee","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:6e9fbb2a9321a9f5e7abd8fa","span_id":"ev_pkt_24"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"试验药物：合成试验药A\n适应症：成人中重度斑块状银屑病\n研究分期：III期\n开发区域：中国\n内在研究目的：确证性研究","quote_sha256":"143053138b63df4dcc738e4d7c2ca91c3f4320c2cc287f3c8021acb5ca9f698a","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"ev_def_drug"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"总体研究设计：平行组（parallel assignment）、双盲、安慰剂对照、随机","quote_sha256":"671a62a354113705569b311f82cdff13e6dc35ab5faac84b8993f18ac7fe7ebc","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"ev_def_design"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"研究人群概述：确诊为斑块状银屑病、疾病严重程度为中重度的成人受试者。","quote_sha256":"a8e79e0e0422cd44b88dc3e21e985b80d8a582156f8af354719235edcd236224","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"ev_def_popdesc"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"入选标准模块：年龄≥18岁；确诊斑块状银屑病≥6个月；筛选及基线时PASI≥12、受累体表面积≥10%、sPGA≥3；适合接受系统治疗或光疗。","quote_sha256":"3e9ca06af65f6aeb7e28df97f2a93f40d8966553fa5faff3f806e43f762999dd","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"ev_def_incl"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"主要研究目的：评价合成试验药A相较安慰剂治疗成人中重度斑块状银屑病的疗效。\n次要研究目的：评价合成试验药A对皮损清除程度及皮肤病相关生活质量的影响。","quote_sha256":"2ac5414e5b404b58a36cba216311b70c374adcc64fbb813ea19e5451f68e54f8","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"ev_def_obj"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"主要终点：第16周达到PASI 75应答（较基线PASI评分改善≥75%）的受试者比例。","quote_sha256":"0726a50bb0c8f1c5ec79b9e21b343bfd08fddc0a595315a5c8e3769df01ce9a7","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"ev_def_ep_primary"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"关键次要终点：第16周sPGA达到0或1且较基线改善≥2级的受试者比例。；第16周达到PASI 90应答的受试者比例。","quote_sha256":"9ebc192fbc05715cf7f717f7f5899cd368f8790a1c880b7a2bff3665ad9ac302","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"ev_def_ep_key"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"其他次要终点：第16周PASI评分较基线的变化。；第16周DLQI评分较基线的变化。","quote_sha256":"1f739c14310a6a5f292991854360290460a4b501e71c36ec724647d8123a4023","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"ev_def_ep_other"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"安全性终点：治疗期间出现的不良事件（TEAE）、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件发生率。；实验室检查、生命体征及12导联心电图具有临床意义的变化。","quote_sha256":"99133b9298d6b094501b14430ac89a3b690a9aa9acb4bb1df325ea3196a44236","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"ev_def_safety"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"研究时期：筛选期：最长4周。；双盲治疗期：16周。；安全性随访期：4周。","quote_sha256":"1df9f3c36a7060d2c1dfbc24b66dd9be14f4efacd4868bd85df3940f627371af","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"ev_def_period"}],"evidence_span_ids":["ev_pkt_24","ev_def_drug","ev_def_design","ev_def_popdesc","ev_def_incl","ev_def_obj","ev_def_ep_primary","ev_def_ep_key","ev_def_ep_other","ev_def_safety","ev_def_period"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":10},"heading":"本研究的理论基础","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究为确证性III期临床研究，拟在成人中重度斑块状银屑病患者中评价合成试验药A相较安慰剂的疗效，并评价合成试验药A对皮损清除程度及皮肤病相关生活质量的影响。目标研究人群为确诊为斑块状银屑病且疾病严重程度为中重度的成人受试者，年龄≥18岁；入选标准要求筛选及基线时PASI≥12、受累体表面积≥10%、sPGA≥3，且受试者适合接受系统治疗或光疗。研究采用随机、双盲、安慰剂对照的平行组设计，双盲治疗期为16周，主要疗效评价在第16周进行，随机、双盲和安慰剂对照有助于降低偏倚对疗效评价的影响，为合成试验药A疗效的确证性评价提供支持。疗效评价以第16周达到PASI 75应答（较基线PASI评分改善≥75%）的受试者比例作为主要终点；关键次要终点包括第16周sPGA达到0或1且较基线改善≥2级的受试者比例和第16周达到PASI 90应答的受试者比例；其他次要终点包括第16周PASI评分较基线的变化和第16周DLQI评分较基线的变化，以评价皮损清除程度及皮肤病相关生活质量。安全性方面，研究将评价治疗期间出现的不良事件、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件发生率，并评价实验室检查、生命体征及12导联心电图具有临床意义的变化。","rationale":"正文依据已确认研究事实撰写：内在研究目的为确证性研究，分期为III期；目标人群为确诊斑块状银屑病且疾病严重程度为中重度的成人受试者，入选标准包括年龄≥18岁、筛选及基线PASI≥12、受累体表面积≥10%、sPGA≥3且适合接受系统治疗或光疗；设计为随机、双盲、安慰剂对照的平行组，双盲治疗期16周；主要终点为第16周PASI 75应答，关键次要终点为第16周sPGA达到0或1且较基线改善≥2级及PASI 90应答，其他次要终点为第16周PASI及DLQI评分较基线变化；安全性终点包括治疗期间出现的不良事件、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件发生率以及实验室检查、生命体征及12导联心电图的临床意义变化。医学作者需核对补充作用机制、流行病学与既往临床证据，以支持疾病负担、剂量选择与终点选择的完整论证；正文中随机、双盲与安慰剂对照有助于降低评价偏倚的表述属方法学推理，需医学作者确认。","review_advisories":["本节提及高影响设计信息（主要终点）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。","本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_650a3ed48fbc8ff8","section_number":"2.4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:6e9fbb2a9321a9f5e7abd8fa","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:b5cb8043e0359e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:367cbc36976ba5","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:d84680fc442c0c"]}],"source_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:6e9fbb2a9321a9f5e7abd8fa","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:6e9fbb2a9321a9f5e7abd8fa","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","text_sha256":"97d014fb8606cbd66b6b61b1c6d22e1f2f4a827bd24db42d4a3e3d23092232ae"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","text_sha256":"787313a6f081b1c9afdf03800feb1c50c317aa4aa4f0c3884e924b0594e666da"},{"locator":"section:3.6.3.3 研究药物的计数|block:620|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:b5cb8043e0359e","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"5d7954edffb46be99638e2135e77631b0c5d64bf28fd8aeb9376a387c2a93b8f"},{"locator":"section:文档开头|block:26|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"33118fc6958419e645c6a0a19471c78f80e0c4c28be03b46f2b3e61d287e0305"},{"locator":"section:独立数据监查委员会|block:792|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:367cbc36976ba5","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"26824e050825b072ae0a7dd2eee48a5657c0d43ba2c463b531efc0feabf1a014"},{"locator":"section:文档开头|block:25|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"68663fd612a1770f44cc3c20e025cf77d568a22b8c10c9a906d5ceb40702d87e"},{"locator":"section:11.4 研究数据记录|block:1218|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:d84680fc442c0c","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"f7aafa4178dd21690460dacca369e7f10ae2fcf13e0a791098b68b6758b2984d"}]}